//! The arginfo of every upstream stub (`ext-src/stubs/*.stub.php`) as Rust statics,
//! generated by `tools/arginfo.py` (`--check` verifies it, and that `gen_stub.php`'s
//! headers say the same); the method tables in each `php*` crate point at them.
//!
//! Without the `php` feature the crate is empty.
